          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ismaili Community Contributes $22 Million To Aga Khan University",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Daily Dawn"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Date: October 15, 2004"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Canadian Ismaili community opened its hearts and the purses to come up with what is being termed the most generous fund-raising effort in its history.... "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Canadian Professionals Contribute $ 5.2 Million To Aga Khan University",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "South Asian Outlook"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Date: October 14, 2004"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Two hundred and sixty Canadian professionals, comprising physicians, lawyers, pharmacists, architects and other professions have pledged 5.2 million dollars in contributions to establish a 'Performing Arts Centre' at the Aga Khan University in Karachi... "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Canadians Pledge $5.2 Million To Aga Khan University",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Weekly Voice"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Date: October 14, 2004"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "TORONTO, Oct 14: A group of 260 Canadian professionals will contribute 5.2 million dollars to establish a Performing Arts Centre at the Aga Khan University in Karachi..."
